      ],
      "source": "https://www.army.mil/article/292576/fort_mccoy_commemorative_area_preserves_army_heritage_showcases_installation_history_through_unique_exhibits_artifacts",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "In 2023, two World War II‑era postcards mailed to Fort McCoy were added to the History Center, showing 1944 headquarters and military police buildings.",
